    "detailed_description": "A short-run time game for preferably 5 players (I did not set a max number of players). Everyone will hunt the host player while the host tries to collect every pellet on the screen. The host is also going to play a top-down version of the game while everyone else is playing from a third person viewpoint. The host gains health from eating the other players, but also losses health when getting eaten by players. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDoesn't seem to work for everyone, I had to mess around with UPNP settings on my router to let the game run normally.",
